        <div class="card pad"><div class="eyebrow mb8">Lampiran poster (PNG / JPG / PDF, maks. 5)</div><div class="tiles" id="iL">${f.lampiran.map((l, i) => `<div class="tile">${/PNG|JPG/i.test(l.tipe) ? `<img ${local[l.file_id] ? `src="${local[l.file_id]}"` : `data-img="${esc(l.file_id)}"`} alt="">` : `<div class="center">${ic('picture_as_pdf', 's24')}<div class="small clamp2">${esc(l.nama)}</div></div>`}<button class="x" data-rm="${i}" aria-label="Hapus">${ic('close', 's16')}</button></div>`).join('')}${f.lampiran.length < 5 ? `<button class="tile drop" id="iU" style="padding:0">${ic('add_photo_alternate', 's24')}<div class="small">Tambah</div></button>` : ''}</div><div class="hint mt8">Foto dikompres otomatis di perangkat sebelum diunggah agar cepat di sinyal lemah.</div></div>
